WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:06.503
Doodle Telephone is the game where a perfectly good sentence slowly turns into nonsense.

2
00:00:06.653 --> 00:00:10.643
It works best with a big group, anywhere from three to twelve people.

3
00:00:11.343 --> 00:00:18.978
Everybody starts by writing a sentence. Anything goes. If your brain freezes, there's a button that writes one for you.

4
00:00:19.678 --> 00:00:25.355
Then the stories start moving. You get somebody else's sentence, and your job is to draw it.

5
00:00:25.505 --> 00:00:29.930
Next round, you get a drawing, and you have to describe it in a sentence.

6
00:00:30.080 --> 00:00:36.853
So it goes back and forth, draw, describe, draw, describe, and every step bends the story a little more.

7
00:00:37.553 --> 00:00:43.006
You only get a minute each time, so don't aim for art. Simple and fast beats pretty.

8
00:00:43.156 --> 00:00:47.624
Whatever you've drawn when the timer runs out gets sent along automatically.

9
00:00:48.324 --> 00:00:55.607
When every story has made its way around the table, the host plays them back one at a time, and this is the best part.

10
00:00:55.757 --> 00:01:01.503
You watch a sentence like, a cat eating pizza, turn into something nobody can explain.

11
00:01:01.653 --> 00:01:06.710
Tap the heart on the steps you loved. Whoever collects the most hearts wears the crown.
